config RING_SYS_LOGIC
	bool "Ring sys: update checks, self-test steps, crash block, watchdog rule, saved time (pure part, no kernel call)"
	select CRC
	help
	  Image size and range checks, the running CRC-32, the 30 s self-test step machine, the update-allowed rule,
	  the crash block format, the watchdog feed decision and the saved-time guess (design/firmware.md sections 9.1
	  to 9.4). Stdint, stdbool, string and the CRC library only.

config RING_SYS
	bool "Ring sys: firmware update, settings, crash capture, watchdog (thin part, hardware only through ring_rhw)"
	depends on RING_RHW
	select RING_SYS_LOGIC
	select REBOOT if !RING_RHW_SIM
	help
	  The update calls on slot 1, the self-test window, the factory flag and saved time in the settings, the crash
	  block in retained memory and the watchdog feed work (design/firmware.md sections 9.1 to 9.4).

